@Wolasi Konu Per our chat re: countdown (cc @Fred Chasen ) when we do a countdown, could we do whole numbers up to 1? Then everything less than 1, could we do it to the nearest tenth? 

Rationale: It feels less jarring for the user to go from 1 ->0 GB. Feels less scary when it says 1 -> .99 GB, .98 GB, etc. 

Q: When we show the countdown, is it showing in real time? Or does the user need to close the panel and reopen it?
